--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf2d7532251303545ab78ab68b00d5cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 17F02_BlackAudioArgument
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequenceId: 17F02_BlackAudioArgument
  notes: '17F02 black-screen argument recording. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_Expanded_Native_English_Lobby_Mia_Commentary.md,
    stable marker 17F02_BlackAudioArgument. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Claire
    text: Why's it off? Ben, did you shut it down?
    holdSeconds: 4.5462265
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: You told it everything. Your whole day. Everything you couldn't tell me
      over dinner.
    holdSeconds: 6.4330187
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: Your boss called you out, you almost lost it, and every word is right there.
      Then I ask how you are and you tell me you're fine.
    holdSeconds: 11.338679
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: You were cooking.
    holdSeconds: 2.2820754
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: You couldn't wait ten minutes until we sat down?
    holdSeconds: 4.5462265
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: I did wait, Ben. By the time you asked, I'd already... I'd already...
    holdSeconds: 6.0556602
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: Already what, Claire?
    holdSeconds: 2.2820754
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: I'd already said it once. Out loud. I was past it. I didn't want to pull
      the whole thing back up again.
    holdSeconds: 9.451886
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: So you can tell that thing. You just can't tell me.
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: You told me to wait!
    holdSeconds: 3.0367923
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: For ten minutes! You couldn't hold it for ten minutes? You had to dump
      it into a machine?
    holdSeconds: 7.9424524
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: It asked me when I walked in. You asked me at dinner. By then...
    holdSeconds: 6.4330187
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: By then I'd already worked through it with the unit. There was nothing
      left to say.
    holdSeconds: 7.1877356
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: Do you hear yourself right now?
    holdSeconds: 3.414151
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: Two weeks, Claire. You haven't told me one real thing in two weeks. I thought
      we were okay. Then I open the log and it's nine to one. Nine times with it.
      Once with me.
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: That doesn't mean I love you any less.
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: Then why wasn't it me?
    holdSeconds: 3.0367923
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: Because you come home exhausted, Ben. Every night. The last time you asked
      before I said something was, what, two weeks ago? It's not that you don't care.
      You just have nothing left by then.
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: It does. It's always there. I start talking and it catches me.
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: It catches you, so you give it everything.
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: It takes the edge off so I don't unload on you every night. You're exhausted
      enough as it is.
    holdSeconds: 8.319811
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: So talking to a machine is something you're doing for me now?
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: It didn't start that way. Lately... maybe a little.
    holdSeconds: 4.5462265
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: Jesus, Claire. Listen to yourself.
    holdSeconds: 3.0367923
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: We bought it together. You signed the same papers I did.
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: I didn't sign up to be replaced.
    holdSeconds: 3.7915094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: You're not being replaced.
    holdSeconds: 2.6594338
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: Then what the hell is it?
    holdSeconds: 3.414151
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: I don't know when it became this.
    holdSeconds: 3.7915094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: Yeah. Me neither.
    holdSeconds: 2.2820754
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
